tariff.description:
Configure {meter}.

{suggestion}

Check and edit the hours, weekend rule, time basis and start date for your Mercury Flat Rates tariff before enabling. The day rate applies outside the night period. This calculates a scheduled rate and usage split, not a live billing signal. Only whole-hour boundaries are supported; multiple peak periods and public-holiday exceptions are not. Changing the schedule creates new statistics and retains the old ones.
